    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The lab is officially launching!! Check out some
&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.wwu.edu/wwu-celebrates-kaiser-borsari-hall-opening-a-landmark-in-sustainable-design&quot;&gt;coverage and photos&lt;/a&gt;
of the opening of our new building, Kaiser Borsari Hall!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I was honored to be included in the ribbon-cutting ceremony, along with our Elios 3
drone, an inspiring piece of Swiss technology. Thank you to everyone involved in this
project, cannot wait to see the projects created in this amazing space!&lt;/p&gt;
